# OPPO HAL daemons shipped under /odm/bin/hw and /vendor/bin/hw.  Their .rc files
# carry no seclabel, so the init_daemon_domain() transition can only fire when the
# binary itself has the matching *_exec type.  Without these labels the daemons
# run in the init domain.  Labels are taken from the stock vendor_file_contexts of
# the RMX3780 dump; only the binaries this device actually ships are listed.
/(vendor|odm)/bin/hw/vendor\.oplus\.hardware\.urcc-service         u:object_r:hal_urcc_default_exec:s0
/(vendor|odm)/bin/hw/vendor\.oplus\.hardware\.charger-V[0-9]+-service u:object_r:hal_charger_oplus_exec:s0
/(vendor|odm)/bin/hw/vendor\.oplus\.hardware\.ormsHalService-aidl-service u:object_r:oplus_orms_aidl_service_exec:s0
